   "rtf": 0.2922796383647754,
   "id": "en_long_03",
   "lang": "en",
   "length": "long",
   "units": 79,
   "text": "The city council met on Tuesday evening to discuss the proposed bicycle lanes along the main avenue. Supporters argued that the lanes would reduce traffic, improve air quality, and make the downtown area safer for families, while several shop owners worried about losing parking spaces in front of their stores. After two hours of public comment, the council voted to approve a one year trial on the northern half of the avenue and to review the results next spring."
  },
  {
   "ttfa_s": 0.048078249994432554,
   "total_s": 12.5891025000019,
   "audio_s": 42.56,
   "sample_rate": 24000,
   "num_bytes": 2042880,
